    "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-dark-dimmed github-light\" style=\"--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;--shiki-light-bg:#fff\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"89\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// ToolCallingChatModel extends [BaseChatModel] with safe tool binding.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"90\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"91\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// Unlike the deprecated [ChatModel.BindTools], [ToolCallingChatModel.WithTools]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"92\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// does not mutate the receiver — it returns a new instance with the given tools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"93\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// attached. This makes it safe to share a base model instance across goroutines</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"94\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// and derive per-request variants with different tool sets:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"95\" data-focus=\"true\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"96\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\tbase, _ := openai.NewChatModel(ctx, cfg)           // shared, no tools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"97\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\twithSearch, _ := base.WithTools([]*schema.ToolInfo{searchTool})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"98\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\twithCalc, _  := base.WithTools([]*schema.ToolInfo{calcTool})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"99\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">type</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\"> ToolCallingChatModel</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\"> interface</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"100\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">\tBaseChatModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"101\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"102\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">\tWithTools</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#E36209\">tools</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\"> []</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">schema</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">ToolInfo</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">) (</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">ToolCallingChatModel</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">error</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"103\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">}</span></span></code></pre>"
