    "endLine": 180,
    "focusLine": 168,
    "totalLines": 1024,
    "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-dark-dimmed github-light\" style=\"--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;--shiki-light-bg:#fff\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"143\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// StreamReader is the consumer side of an Eino stream.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"144\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"145\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// A StreamReader is read-once: only one goroutine should call Recv, and the</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"146\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// reader must be closed exactly once (whether the loop finishes normally or</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"147\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// exits early via break or return).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"148\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"149\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// Typical usage:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"150\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"151\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\tdefer sr.Close() // always close, even after io.EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"152\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\tfor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"153\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\t    chunk, err := sr.Recv()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"154\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\t    if errors.Is(err, io.EOF) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"155\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\t        break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"156\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\t    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"157\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\t    if err != nil {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"158\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\t        return err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"159\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\t    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"160\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\t    process(chunk)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"161\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"162\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"163\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// To fan-out a single stream to N independent consumers, call [StreamReader.Copy]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"164\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// before any Recv; the original reader becomes unusable after the call.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"165\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"166\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// StreamReaders are created by [Pipe], [StreamReaderFromArray],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"167\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#768390;--shiki-light:#6A737D\">// [MergeStreamReaders], [MergeNamedStreamReaders], and [StreamReaderWithConvert].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"168\" data-focus=\"true\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">type</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\"> StreamReader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#E36209\">T</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\"> any</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">] </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">struct</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"169\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">\ttyp </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">readerType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"170\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"171\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">\tst </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">stream</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">T</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"172\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"173\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">\tar </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">arrayReader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">T</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"174\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"175\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">\tmsr </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">multiStreamReader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">T</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"176\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"177\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">\tsrw </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">streamReaderWithConvert</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">T</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"178\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"179\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">\tcsr </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F47067;--shiki-light:#D73A49\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">childStreamReader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1\">T</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\" data-ln=\"180\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7;--shiki-light:#24292E\">}</span></span></code></pre>"
